	(descr "AGMSEMI AGM210MAP N+P MOSFET pair, PDFN3.3x3.3-8 with two drain pads (body 3.10 x 3.10, leads 3.30, pitch 0.65). Pins (top view, DS p1): 1 S1 N-source, 2 G1 N-gate, 3 S2 P-source, 4 G2 P-gate, 5/6 + EP '5' D2 P-drain, 7/8 + EP '8' D1 N-drain. Half-bridge use: both drains = phase. Lands derived from DS VER2.73 p9 (dual-pad drawing; the DS gives no land pattern): leads 0.35 x 0.65 (heel 0.05, toe 0.20), EPs 1.87 x 1.125 merged with the tab toe, tabs 0.51 x 0.35; EP paste 2 windows each (71 %). Via-in-pad allowed in the EPs (filled+capped, D41). LCSC C7431169. https://www.lcsc.com/datasheet/C7431169.pdf")
	(tags "AGM210MAP AGMSEMI PDFN3.3x3.3 DFN-8 dual MOSFET N+P half-bridge complementary")
